# Standing conflict classes for bmux fork sync
# Format: <action>: <glob>
#
# keep-deleted: files removed in this fork that upstream might re-introduce
# take-theirs: regenerable files where upstream's version is always preferred

# Upstream CLA Assistant workflow (requires workflow PAT scope not held by automated sync bot)
